WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:30:02.890 --> 00:30:05.130
I'm being space jammed!

00:30:18.740 --> 00:30:21.770
Tim! Tim! Wake up!

00:30:23.340 --> 00:30:25.640
Am I dead? Is this heaven?

00:30:25.780 --> 00:30:30.380
No! You just watched so much anime 
that you got sent into our world.

00:30:30.520 --> 00:30:33.240
You've basically achieved a 
higher level of consciousness.

00:30:33.390 --> 00:30:35.590
From... Watching anime?

00:30:35.720 --> 00:30:37.110
Yup! Check this out!

00:30:37.260 --> 00:30:39.740
Anime Awards Genjutsu!

00:30:40.440 --> 00:30:42.890
Dang, Hime! When did ya learn how to do that?

00:30:43.020 --> 00:30:45.720
I've had a lot of free time lately.

00:30:45.860 --> 00:30:47.610
You need a better outfit.

00:31:02.770 --> 00:31:05.700
Whoa! I'm lookin' good as hell. Thanks, Hime.

00:31:05.830 --> 00:31:09.070
Now that you're here in the anime 
world, anything is possible.

00:31:09.190 --> 00:31:10.430
Anything, huh?

00:31:10.570 --> 00:31:13.940
So I could have friends, and we 
could make an anime together?

00:31:14.060 --> 00:31:16.240
Yeah! If you have at least two friends, sure!

00:31:16.380 --> 00:31:19.450
Turn into a lizard man who loves dumplings?

00:31:19.590 --> 00:31:20.650
Uh-huh.

00:31:20.780 --> 00:31:23.250
Eat some demon fingies?

00:31:23.390 --> 00:31:25.000
Uh-huh!

00:31:25.140 --> 00:31:27.930
Or I could start the Anime Awards?

00:31:28.070 --> 00:31:28.850
Yeah!

00:31:28.990 --> 00:31:29.990
Alrighty!

00:31:30.110 --> 00:31:31.110
Hey, everyone!

00:31:31.240 --> 00:31:35.630
We are gathered here for this special 
night in the anime community

00:31:35.760 --> 00:31:38.300
where fans and industry come together

00:31:38.440 --> 00:31:41.600
to honor the best of the best in anime.

00:31:41.740 --> 00:31:45.470
We have a lot ahead, including special 
announcements and anime previews,

00:31:45.590 --> 00:31:47.210
messages from creators in Japan,

00:31:47.340 --> 00:31:51.340
and of course, all of our 
award winners revealed.

00:31:51.640 --> 00:31:54.530
We also have some friends around 
the world co-streaming the awards.

00:31:54.670 --> 00:31:56.510
You're welcome to watch with 
them on their channels.

00:31:56.640 --> 00:31:57.870
Say "Hello" everyone!

00:31:57.870 --> 00:31:59.157
Hello Everyone!

00:31:59.157 --> 00:32:01.100
Hola Crunchyroll!
Welcome to the Anime Awards!

00:32:01.100 --> 00:32:05.800
Fun fact: Tonight's nominees were 
determined by two rounds of voting.

00:32:05.940 --> 00:32:09.310
The first from a panel 
of fifty esteemed judges,

00:32:09.440 --> 00:32:11.900
then we turned to you: the public,

00:32:12.040 --> 00:32:16.390
who came at us loud and clear with 
millions and millions of votes.

00:32:16.540 --> 00:32:19.550
Thank you, everyone, and a big 
thank you to tonight's sponsor

00:32:19.690 --> 00:32:23.800
Princess Connect! Re:Dive! The most 
anticipated mobile RPG from Japan!

00:32:23.950 --> 00:32:25.310
Now available worldwide.

00:32:25.450 --> 00:32:27.390
We couldn't have done it 
without you, Priconne!

00:32:27.530 --> 00:32:31.290
But! Before we start, Tim, I 
am going to do one more thing.

00:32:32.990 --> 00:32:35.950
Okay! Now without further ado...

