00:41:15.300 --> 00:41:19.690
And the winner for Best Voice 
Actor Performance (Japanese) is...

00:41:21.240 --> 00:41:24.200
YUSUKE KOBAYASHI
NATSUKI SUBARU
RE:ZERO - STARTING LIFE IN ANOTHER WORLD - (SEASON 2)

00:41:24.410 --> 00:41:26.640
You like me and I like you,

00:41:26.850 --> 00:41:29.420
you're good to me and you love me,

00:41:29.630 --> 00:41:31.880
but you're also stricter 
with me than anyone else.

00:41:32.440 --> 00:41:35.050
Rem is the one girl who 
doesn't go easy on me!

00:41:38.460 --> 00:41:39.720
Hello, everyone!

00:41:39.900 --> 00:41:43.920
I'm Yusuke Kobayashi, the voice of Subaru Natsuki 
in Re:ZERO - Starting Life In Another World - Season 2.

00:41:44.110 --> 00:41:46.590
I'm thrilled to accept the award for Best 
Japanese Voice Actor in Crunchyroll's Anime Awards.

00:41:46.720 --> 00:41:49.930
I really can't believe I won.

00:41:50.160 --> 00:41:51.580
All I've done is just charge

00:41:51.900 --> 00:41:55.320
into the role as Subaru Natsuki.

00:41:55.480 --> 00:41:59.800
But I'm more glad for the 
love Subaru has received

00:41:59.950 --> 00:42:01.900
than I am for myself.

00:42:02.030 --> 00:42:04.440
Thank you for so warmly accepting him.

00:42:04.590 --> 00:42:06.320
And if my voice has left something 
in your hearts through Subaru,

00:42:06.470 --> 00:42:09.720
nothing could make me happier as an actor.

00:42:09.870 --> 00:42:13.820
I'll keep doing my best to 
move all of your hearts.

00:42:14.000 --> 00:42:18.120
To all the fans around the 
world, who support this anime,

00:42:18.270 --> 00:42:21.000
to everyone who participated 
in this awards show,

00:42:21.150 --> 00:42:24.220
to the original author,

00:42:24.360 --> 00:42:27.600
and to all the anime cast and staff,

00:42:27.740 --> 00:42:30.200
I want to send you all my sincerest thanks.

00:42:30.350 --> 00:42:33.660
Please continue to support 
the series as well as myself.

00:42:33.820 --> 00:42:35.010
This was Yusuke Kobayashi.

00:42:40.370 --> 00:42:43.990
English voice actors take on the hard 
task of bringing beloved characters

00:42:44.130 --> 00:42:45.930
to a brand-new audience,

00:42:46.110 --> 00:42:49.210
while preserving the things 
that make them special.

