So I will focus on those in the most danger!

00:43:04.380 --> 00:43:06.640
JONAH SCOTT
LEGOSHI
BEASTARS

00:43:07.150 --> 00:43:09.180
Do I look like the devil to you?

00:43:11.250 --> 00:43:12.680
Don't worry, Haru.

00:43:13.180 --> 00:43:15.610
ANAIRIS QUIÑONES
ECHIDNA
RE:ZERO - STARTING LIFE IN ANOTHER WORLD - (SEASON 2)

00:43:15.750 --> 00:43:18.520
Let me affirm the desires, the curiosities

00:43:18.670 --> 00:43:21.910
and the greed that you seek 
to satisfy with answers.

00:43:22.840 --> 00:43:24.910
AARON PHILLIPS
LAURENT THIERRY
GREAT PRETENDER

00:43:25.180 --> 00:43:28.920
This uses their advanced pharmaceuticals 
and the latest synthetic narcotic.

00:43:29.080 --> 00:43:30.370
It's magic.

00:43:30.620 --> 00:43:31.980
"Sakura magic."

00:43:32.120 --> 00:43:33.950
CRISPIN FREEMAN
ZIUSUDRA
FATE/GRAND ORDER ABSOLUTE DEMONIC FRONT: BABYLONIA

00:43:34.090 --> 00:43:37.260
No need for dismay, I still owe you a favor.

00:43:37.390 --> 00:43:41.700
A callow neophyte you may be, but your 
steadfastness compensates for it.

00:43:42.140 --> 00:43:44.190
JOHNNY YONG BOSCH
BAM
TOWER OF GOD

00:43:44.550 --> 00:43:48.100
I didn't know that word yet at the 
time, but it's how I felt in my heart.

00:43:48.520 --> 00:43:50.140
No one could ever replace you.

00:43:55.760 --> 00:44:00.110
And the winner for Best Voice 
Actor Performance in English is...

00:44:01.840 --> 00:44:04.660
ZENO ROBINSON
HAWKS
MY HERO ACADEMIA SEASON 4

00:44:04.870 --> 00:44:07.660
I won't be able to get 
everyone out of the building.

00:44:10.270 --> 00:44:11.770
I don't have enough feathers...

00:44:11.910 --> 00:44:14.370
So I will focus on those in the most danger!

00:44:18.350 --> 00:44:21.980
Everyone! Ah wow! Thank you so much.

00:44:22.140 --> 00:44:23.630
I am honored

00:44:23.760 --> 00:44:28.680
and blessed to accept the Crunchyroll 
award for best performance in English

00:44:28.810 --> 00:44:30.650
as Hawks in My Hero Academia.

00:44:30.780 --> 00:44:34.430
I love the show. I love working 
on it. I love everyone involved.

00:44:35.240 --> 00:44:38.550
In my heart of hearts, I am accepting 
this alongside Anairis and Jonah,

00:44:38.990 --> 00:44:41.810
who I am big fans of. They 
inspire me to be better,

00:44:41.950 --> 00:44:43.640
and I love you both.

00:44:44.760 --> 00:44:49.040
And I'd like to dedicate this moment,

00:44:49.160 --> 00:44:52.620
this award, this achievement

00:44:52.800 --> 00:44:55.130
to all my actors of color out there,

00:44:55.320 --> 00:44:59.180
and anime fans of color out there,

00:44:59.670 --> 00:45:00.980
my black actors

00:45:01.180 --> 00:45:05.850
and the black anime fans who have 
carried this medium on their back

00:45:06.410 --> 00:45:09.240
and our culture for as long 
as I have been a fan of it.

00:45:09.770 --> 00:45:12.240
We may not have always felt represented,

00:45:12.480 --> 00:45:15.160
or seen, or reflected

00:45:16.110 --> 00:45:17.330
in this medium

00:45:18.370 --> 00:45:21.660
because you all love anime. So I see you.

00:45:22.770 --> 00:45:23.810
I love you.

00:45:24.670 --> 00:45:26.570
Thank you. God bless.

00:45:26.900 --> 00:45:28.330
Heyo!

00:45:33.770 --> 00:45:38.070
Oh, this is a pretty good Anime 
Awards, if I do say so myself.

00:45:38.210 --> 00:45:39.470
We're doing a great job.

00:45:39.620 --> 00:45:43.480
Can you believe Toilet-Bound Hanako-Kun \Nwon for best character design?

00:45:43.620 --> 00:45:46.190
I mean, what's not to love 
about a haunted toilet?

00:45:46.340 --> 00:45:47.620
I could think of a few things,

00:45:47.770 --> 00:45:51.800
but how about Zeno Robinson 
bringing home the win as Hawks?

00:45:51.950 --> 00:45:56.420
Man, the only thing that could 
make this better would be a...

00:45:57.040 --> 00:45:59.270
World Premiere.

00:46:17.170 --> 00:46:19.710
So... Are you happy?

00:46:20.250 --> 00:46:22.380
You can run away at any time.

00:46:23.130 --> 00:46:26.760
It's not like I've trapped you 
in here or tied you down.

00:46:26.760 --> 00:46:29.180
You came here on your own.

00:46:32.930 --> 00:46:34.390
So where to?

00:46:42.460 --> 00:46:46.300
Hello, everyone watching the Anime Awards!

00:46:46.300 --> 00:46:47.690
I'm Natsuki Hanae.

00:46:48.190 --> 00:46:52.020
Thank you for always loving 
Japanese anime so much.

00:46:52.370 --> 00:46:57.670
I will be voicing the protagonist 
Odokawa in the anime Odd Taxi.

00:46:57.670 --> 00:47:01.110
Odokawa doesn't really like 
to get involved with others.

00:47:01.110 --> 00:47:07.760
He's pretty stubborn, reserved, 
and a rather unique taxi driver.

00:47:07.930 --> 00:47:14.390
Odd Taxi is a show about Odokawa 
having seemingly meaningless conversations

00:47:14.390 --> 00:47:18.680
with his unique customers 
eventually leading to a missing girl.

00:47:18.910 --> 00:47:23.980
This is an original animation 
like you've never seen before.

00:47:24.300 --> 00:47:27.140
Please check out this series!

00:47:27.520 --> 00:47:29.400
Watch on Crunchyroll!

00:47:35.040 --> 00:47:38.620
On that day, I lost everything.

00:47:44.590 --> 00:47:46.970
I can't die yet.

00:47:47.970 --> 00:47:49.840
Not until I have my revenge.

00:47:49.970 --> 00:47:54.350
The 64th year of the Meiji Era.

00:47:54.350 --> 00:47:56.310
Tokugawa Yoshinobu still reigns.

00:47:56.310 --> 00:47:57.850
Things look nice and peaceful on the surface 
thanks to Yoshinobu-sama, don't they?
Tokugawa Yoshinobu still reigns.

00:47:57.850 --> 00:48:00.600
Things look nice and peaceful on the surface 
thanks to Yoshinobu-sama, don't they?

00:48:00.980 --> 00:48:04.820
But they don't know a thing.

00:48:04.820 --> 00:48:06.530
Hey, Yuki onee-chan!

00:48:08.030 --> 00:48:10.450
Sentiment can be cruel.

00:48:11.120 --> 00:48:14.660
I know, because my emotions get 
the best of me sometimes, as well.

00:48:14.660 --> 00:48:16.330
What a boring bunch.

00:48:16.910 --> 00:48:18.290
If you're going to fall,

00:48:18.290 --> 00:48:20.790
why not dance with as many butterflies 
as you can, on the way down?

00:48:21.000 --> 00:48:22.920
Get rid of any emotions you don't need.

00:48:23.250 --> 00:48:26.460
I'm going to use you 
to purify Nue.

00:48:26.840 --> 00:48:29.840
And you're going to use 
me to get your revenge.

00:48:52.740 --> 00:48:55.330
Get your revenge on me in Hell.

00:48:56.080 --> 00:48:57.700
I'll join you there soon enough.

