00:55:10.620 --> 00:55:17.560
I didn't realise so many people would be
interested in animation so I'm very happy.

00:55:19.800 --> 00:55:22.700
While I was working on this series,
 I would occasionally

00:55:22.860 --> 00:55:25.640
