00:55:26.290 --> 00:55:29.800
We also made the ending sequence together.

00:55:29.950 --> 00:55:32.510
Those are very fond memories.

00:55:33.830 --> 00:55:37.650
I'm very thankful to everyone

00:55:37.790 --> 00:55:39.140
who supported our endeavors.
Thank you very much.

