00:57:48.140 --> 00:57:51.920
You guys are fantastic people. Thank 
you so much for being a part of this.

00:57:52.520 --> 00:57:56.490
And yet I hope everyone is safe, 
healthy and I hope to see you soon.

00:57:56.630 --> 00:57:57.660
