01:01:26.330 --> 01:01:28.880
I loved hearing from some 
of our favorite creators.

01:01:29.020 --> 01:01:33.210
I know! All this excitement though 
is uh, kinda making me hungry.

01:01:36.650 --> 01:01:40.440
Maybe I'll get a banana split...

01:01:40.560 --> 01:01:43.290
You think they feel weird 
about selling bananas?

01:01:43.420 --> 01:01:45.630
Ya know... As food...

01:02:00.480 --> 01:02:03.660
I think it's time

01:02:03.800 --> 01:02:06.990
for some more announcements 
and special guests!

01:02:07.110 --> 01:02:08.490
Roll the tape...

01:02:42.990 --> 01:02:47.700
No... after we finally all managed 
to get on stage together...

01:02:48.160 --> 01:02:50.290
It can't end like this...

01:02:52.500 --> 01:02:53.790
It ain't over yet!

01:02:53.790 --> 01:02:57.500
Now, get your butts on the stage and 
give the crowd a taste of your souls!

01:02:57.840 --> 01:03:00.670
It was a crazy idea from the start...

01:03:00.670 --> 01:03:03.380
This zombies-as-idols business.

01:03:05.090 --> 01:03:08.050
Hell, Saga itself is barely hanging in there!

01:03:08.970 --> 01:03:12.180
If we don't get better, we'll never 
be more than third-rate idols.

01:03:13.270 --> 01:03:15.560
That will mean never getting our revenge.

01:03:17.310 --> 01:03:20.070
I suppose we could build 
a whole new Saga, then.

01:03:21.230 --> 01:03:24.530
It'll be okay! And Franchouchou's 
gonna get revenge!

01:03:29.620 --> 01:03:32.790
I want to get on stage again! 
I'm not gonna let anything stop me!

01:03:40.210 --> 01:03:42.000
Smash it!

01:03:42.000 --> 01:03:43.630
Show business has always been

01:03:43.630 --> 01:03:46.130
a competition where you have 
to constantly be on your toes.

01:03:46.130 --> 01:03:49.890
I'll show you what kind of show 
the reigning champions can put on.

01:03:49.890 --> 01:03:53.310
We'll have to make the show 
a success by ourselves.

01:03:53.770 --> 01:03:56.560
I chose you all to save Saga,

01:03:56.560 --> 01:03:58.520
and brought you back to life,

01:03:58.520 --> 01:03:59.810
because nothing is impossible for you!

01:04:03.150 --> 01:04:06.950
REVENGE!

01:04:13.540 --> 01:04:15.620
Airing April 2021

01:04:17.620 --> 01:04:24.090
Hello everyone! I'm the director of
ZOMBIE LAND SAGA REVENGE, Munehisa Sakai. 

01:04:24.090 --> 01:04:30.930
ZOMBIE LAND SAGA REVENGE is going to
be full of more unpredictable twist

01:04:30.930 --> 01:04:36.890
and wonderful songs, and I really
hope you will all enjoy it.

01:04:37.180 --> 01:04:44.150
We've been pouring even more passion
into our work than Season 1,

01:04:44.150 --> 01:04:47.490
maybe a bit too much
at times, to the point

01:04:52.200 --> 01:04:56.620
but our entire staff is working together
tomake sure it turns out great,

01:04:56.660 --> 01:04:59.420
so please look forward to it!

01:05:00.580 --> 01:05:05.250
Make sure to check out ZOMBIE LAND
 SAGA REVENGE on Crunchyroll

01:05:05.250 --> 01:05:06.460
Thank you very much!

01:05:14.220 --> 01:05:19.440
Hello Crunchyroll Anime Awards viewers!

01:05:19.770 --> 01:05:22.190
I'm Kobayashi Yuusuke, 
the voice of Natsuki Subaru

01:05:22.190 --> 01:05:24.900
in Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-.

01:05:24.900 --> 01:05:28.570
And I'm Takahashi Rie, 
the voice of Emilia. Hello!

01:05:28.650 --> 01:05:34.320
So Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- 
is streaming around the world,

01:05:34.320 --> 01:05:35.620
making it even more popular.

01:05:35.620 --> 01:05:36.490
Yay!

01:05:36.490 --> 01:05:39.200
Thank you so much!

01:05:39.200 --> 01:05:45.340
And we're told that the second cour 
of the second season is now streaming.

01:05:45.340 --> 01:05:48.300
Are you all making sure to watch it?

01:05:49.380 --> 01:05:52.590
Thank you!

01:05:52.590 --> 01:05:54.970
Yes, the second cour of the second season

01:05:54.970 --> 01:05:57.850
should be around the halfway point by now.

01:05:57.850 --> 01:05:58.560
Yes.

01:05:58.560 --> 01:06:01.520
I think this is a good time to share 
the stand-out features

01:06:01.520 --> 01:06:05.650
of our characters, Emilia and Subaru, 
at this point in the story.

01:06:05.650 --> 01:06:07.980
Well, Subaru...

01:06:07.980 --> 01:06:13.610
He's been through a lot 
of very painful experiences,

01:06:13.610 --> 01:06:15.870
and now he's getting more scenes

01:06:15.870 --> 01:06:19.910
about the amazing things he does 
to brush all that off.

01:06:19.910 --> 01:06:21.210
That's true.

01:06:21.210 --> 01:06:27.500
It was starting to feel like a lot of... 
circumstances... were closing in on him,

01:06:27.500 --> 01:06:31.050
but now, as you can even see 
in the opening sequence,

01:06:31.050 --> 01:06:32.880
he starts to actually fight.

01:06:32.880 --> 01:06:34.800
Yeah. Actually...

01:06:34.800 --> 01:06:40.770
His interactions with Garfiel 
have really stuck in my mind.

01:06:40.770 --> 01:06:42.230
Oh!

01:06:42.230 --> 01:06:46.440
They're both characters that yell a lot,

01:06:46.440 --> 01:06:51.650
so if one lashes out with one exclamation 
point, the other will hit back with two.

01:06:51.650 --> 01:06:55.490
Then three, and in the end... 
It's not actually in the script,

01:06:55.490 --> 01:06:59.080
but I can imagine ten exclamation 
points on a single line!

01:06:59.080 --> 01:07:03.120
So I was told, "You went 
a bit too far there."

01:07:03.120 --> 01:07:04.290
You got a little too passionate.

01:07:04.290 --> 01:07:05.250
Yeah, yeah.

01:07:05.250 --> 01:07:09.340
That's just how heated they get 
with each other.

01:07:09.340 --> 01:07:12.670
That episode left a deep impression on me.

01:07:12.670 --> 01:07:14.380
Wow, that's a good one.

01:07:14.380 --> 01:07:15.680
How about Emilia-tan?

01:07:15.680 --> 01:07:21.600
For Emilia, the big thing is that she started undergoing her trial in Ep42.

01:07:21.600 --> 01:07:29.400
Well, she started it, but it's more like 
her real trial has yet to begin,

01:07:29.400 --> 01:07:35.070
and I think everyone will be able to 
learn a lot more about Emilia from it.

01:07:35.070 --> 01:07:40.700
I got to know Emilia a lot better myself 
by voicing her in this episode,

01:07:40.700 --> 01:07:44.710
and it made me want to 
hold on to that feeling

01:07:44.710 --> 01:07:47.170
while I voice her from now on

01:07:47.170 --> 01:07:51.300
so I can enjoy this arc along 
with all the viewers.

01:07:51.420 --> 01:07:54.380
Speaking of ep40... Emilia-tan...

01:07:54.380 --> 01:07:57.090
Ah, the special ending theme!

01:07:57.090 --> 01:08:01.350
Yes, there's a song I sang as Emilia 
that'll be used as an ending theme.

01:08:01.350 --> 01:08:04.430
I hope that, after watching 
that scene in the episode,

01:08:04.430 --> 01:08:10.940
everyone will pay close attention 
to the voice and lyrics in that song.

01:08:11.190 --> 01:08:13.440
This turned out to be mostly about us,

01:08:13.440 --> 01:08:17.570
but all the other characters, 
like Garfiel, Ram, and all the others...

01:08:17.570 --> 01:08:18.950
Yes, there are lots of them.

01:08:18.950 --> 01:08:22.700
Yes and they each get their 
own moment in the spotlight.

01:08:22.700 --> 01:08:25.370
You won't want to tear your 
eyes away for a moment

01:08:25.370 --> 01:08:29.290
as the second season dives 
into its second half.

01:08:29.290 --> 01:08:31.690
Please make sure you don't miss it!

01:08:31.690 --> 01:08:35.050
So this has been Kobayashi Yuusuke, 
the voice of Natsuki Subaru

01:08:35.050 --> 01:08:37.470
in Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-...

01:08:37.470 --> 01:08:39.680
And Takahashi Rie, the voice of Emilia.

01:08:39.680 --> 01:08:40.890
One, two...

01:08:40.890 --> 01:08:44.060
Watch on Crunchyroll!

