We all know there can be no anime 
with no main characters, duh.

01:13:36.470 --> 01:13:40.320
This year's Best Protagonist features stars 
from the court, to the drawing board,

01:13:40.480 --> 01:13:42.930
everything in between.

01:13:43.210 --> 01:13:46.490
Please welcome the nominees 
for Best Protagonist:

01:13:47.680 --> 01:13:49.860
NATSUME
