01:13:55.910 --> 01:13:59.620
SHOYO HINATA
HAIKYU!! TO THE TOP

01:14:03.860 --> 01:14:06.300
YUJI ITADORI
JUJUTSU KAISEN

01:14:11.820 --> 01:14:15.090
MIDORI ASAKUSA
KEEP YOUR HANDS OFF EIZOUKEN!

01:14:19.870 --> 01:14:21.530
CATARINA CLAES

01:14:21.890 --> 01:14:25.760
MY NEXT LIFE AS A VILLAINESS: 
ALL ROUTES LEAD TO DOOM!

01:14:27.940 --> 01:14:32.070
ANOS VOLDIGOAD
THE MISFIT OF DEMON KING ACADEMY

01:14:40.810 --> 01:14:44.160
And the winner for Best Protagonist is...

01:14:46.640 --> 01:14:47.920
CATARINA CLAES

01:14:48.050 --> 01:14:52.130
MY NEXT LIFE AS A VILLAINESS: 
ALL ROUTES LEAD TO DOOM!

01:15:07.750 --> 01:15:09.010
Villains...

01:15:09.170 --> 01:15:11.450
Whether you love to hate 
them or hate to love them

01:15:11.580 --> 01:15:14.890
Let's take a look at the wicked 
line up for our next category.

01:15:17.290 --> 01:15:20.410
Please welcome the nominees 
for Best Antagonist:

01:15:21.500 --> 01:15:23.370
EN
DOROHEDORO

01:15:29.520 --> 01:15:32.880
OVERHAUL
MY HERO ACADEMIA SEASON 4

01:15:37.500 --> 01:15:40.040
RYOMEN SUKUNA
JUJUTSU KAISEN

01:15:45.640 --> 01:15:48.700
AKITO SOMA
FRUITS BASKET (SEASON 2)

01:15:53.420 --> 01:15:57.770
ECHIDNA
RE:ZERO - STARTING LIFE IN ANOTHER WORLD -
(SEASON 2)

01:16:01.660 --> 01:16:03.530
RACHEL
TOWER OF GOD

01:16:15.520 --> 01:16:19.120
And the winner for Best Antagonist is...

01:16:21.240 --> 01:16:24.120
RYOMEN SUKUNA
JUJUTSU KAISEN

01:16:41.610 --> 01:16:44.840
Ryomen Sukuna for Best Antagonist? Wow!

01:16:44.990 --> 01:16:49.520
It is truly a treat to celebrate all 
of these great characters and creators.

01:16:49.660 --> 01:16:53.670
So, let's take a moment to shine a 
little light on this evening's sponsor

01:16:53.880 --> 01:16:54.770
as a thank you.

01:16:54.910 --> 01:16:58.010
Princess Connect! Re:Dive has 
some pretty spicy villains, too.

01:16:58.150 --> 01:17:00.710
Like a certain mysterious fox we'll see soon.

01:17:00.850 --> 01:17:03.510
They're like me, but way scarier.

01:17:03.680 --> 01:17:07.430
This game is jam-packed 
with adorable heroines.

01:17:07.570 --> 01:17:08.600
It's got something for everyone.

01:17:08.740 --> 01:17:11.100
So, let's check it out.

01:17:38.650 --> 01:17:41.050
Princess Connect! Re:Dive

01:19:07.720 --> 01:19:10.020
We also have an exclusive preview

01:19:10.160 --> 01:19:13.740
and cast commentary for Tokyo Revengers.

01:19:13.890 --> 01:19:15.650
I love this series!

01:19:15.790 --> 01:19:18.450
It's got it all. Mysteries, time travel,

01:19:18.600 --> 01:19:20.570
delinquents, peak aesthetics

01:19:20.700 --> 01:19:24.110
and it's all jam-packed in a dude's quest

01:19:24.250 --> 01:19:27.090
to save the only girlfriend he's ever had.

01:19:28.060 --> 01:19:29.440
Let's roll the tape.

01:21:53.890 --> 01:21:57.020
Hello! I'm Yuuki Shin and 
I play Takemichi Hanagaki.

01:21:57.020 --> 01:22:00.140
Thank you for watching the
 Crunchyroll Anime Awards.

01:22:00.140 --> 01:22:05.690
In Tokyo Revengers, Takemichi Hangaki, a 
failure of a part-timer at the end of his ropes,

01:22:05.690 --> 01:22:08.280
ends up traveling back in time to when he was

01:22:08.280 --> 01:22:10.650
at his peak in middle school.

01:22:10.650 --> 01:22:12.950
In order to save his one and only girlfriend,

01:22:12.950 --> 01:22:16.870
Hinata Tachibana, and protect her

01:22:16.870 --> 01:22:21.170
as well as try to change his own life, 
he tries to get revenge on his life.

01:22:21.170 --> 01:22:23.500
This is one of the best 
passionate and bittersweet

01:22:23.500 --> 01:22:25.420
time-travel suspense stories you'll see.

01:22:25.840 --> 01:22:28.340
Takemichi Hanagaki, who I play,

01:22:28.340 --> 01:22:31.930
will protect Hina at all costs.

01:22:31.930 --> 01:22:35.550
In order to save her and his 
friends, he's going to change

01:22:35.550 --> 01:22:38.970
the version of himself that 
he'd been running away from

01:22:38.970 --> 01:22:42.900
and face any hardships. 
He is a very cool character.

01:22:42.900 --> 01:22:45.940
I am putting everything 
I have into this role.

01:22:45.940 --> 01:22:49.990
It's going to be an amazing series, 
so please watch it on Crunchyroll.

01:22:50.780 --> 01:22:53.610
Hello, everyone. I'm eill.

01:22:53.990 --> 01:22:57.700
Thank you for watching the
 Crunchyroll Anime Awards. 

01:22:57.700 --> 01:23:02.290
I will be singing the ending 
theme for Tokyo Revengers.

01:23:02.290 --> 01:23:04.710
The song "Koko de Iki wo Shite"

01:23:04.710 --> 01:23:07.590
is a song that depicts

01:23:07.590 --> 01:23:09.840
Hinata Tachibana's feelings.

01:23:09.840 --> 01:23:14.390
"True love can survive any place and 
time and you just need to breathe,"

01:23:14.390 --> 01:23:17.640
were my thoughts writing this song.

01:23:17.640 --> 01:23:21.180
I hope you can all find a 
place like that as well.

01:23:21.430 --> 01:23:24.270
Please watch Tokyo Revengers on Crunchyroll.

01:23:24.270 --> 01:23:26.400
Thank you!

01:23:33.160 --> 01:23:37.280
It's been an amazing evening so far and we 
couldn't have done it without all of you!

01:23:37.440 --> 01:23:41.180
Let's throw it over to our fans to hear 
their predictions for anime of the year.

01:23:41.540 --> 01:23:44.270
For anime of the Year I chose 
Keep Your Hands Off Eizouken!

01:23:44.410 --> 01:23:46.000
Keep Your Hands Off Eizouken!

01:23:46.160 --> 01:23:47.500
Keep Your Hands Off Eizouken!

01:23:47.650 --> 01:23:49.890
will win Anime of the Year

01:23:50.030 --> 01:23:52.700
both for it's inventiveness and for its
importance in the world of anime.

01:23:52.840 --> 01:23:55.580
I think Dorohedoro deserves
to win Anime of the Year.

01:23:55.710 --> 01:23:59.370
I think it has a super amazing setting,
I love its entire cast of characters...

01:23:59.510 --> 01:24:00.700
Dorohedoro for the win.

01:24:00.840 --> 01:24:03.440
I think that Appare-Ranman! \Nshould be Anime of the Year

01:24:03.570 --> 01:24:06.240
because it has a really diverse cast

01:24:06.380 --> 01:24:08.050
with a lot of great synergy.

01:24:08.180 --> 01:24:10.540
The Anime of the Year will be JUJUTSU KAISEN

01:24:10.690 --> 01:24:14.420
because I absolutely love the characters 
and the incredible fights in the series.

01:24:14.570 --> 01:24:16.960
It's simply JUJUTSU KAISEN!

01:24:17.100 --> 01:24:17.890
JUJUTSU KAISEN.

01:24:18.050 --> 01:24:18.970
JUJUTSU KAISEN.

01:24:19.110 --> 01:24:20.280
JUJUTSU KAISEN.

01:24:20.450 --> 01:24:21.310
BEASTARS.

01:24:21.450 --> 01:24:24.070
I think BEASTARS will win Anime of the Year.

01:24:24.200 --> 01:24:27.680
I think BEASTARS really pushed 
the limits on modern anime.

01:24:27.830 --> 01:24:31.450
The Anime of the Year at the Anime Awards?
Honestly I hope it will be Great Pretender!

01:24:31.680 --> 01:24:32.320
Great Pretender.

01:24:32.460 --> 01:24:33.280
Great Pretender.

01:24:33.410 --> 01:24:36.000
I gotta go with Great Pretender.
Second season was fire.

01:24:40.090 --> 01:24:44.170
There have been a lot of 
fantastic winners tonight.

01:24:44.300 --> 01:24:47.320
Each show the tremendous effort and talent

01:24:47.480 --> 01:24:51.520
that went into producing the 
art we all love and cherish.

01:24:51.690 --> 01:24:55.740
Anime brought us new worlds, 
new powers and new friends.

01:24:55.890 --> 01:25:00.290
Anime was there to give us the strength 
we needed to face every new day

01:25:00.440 --> 01:25:02.750
no matter how hard it was.

01:25:03.290 --> 01:25:04.890
But now,

01:25:05.020 --> 01:25:09.470
it is time to look at the best of the best,

01:25:09.630 --> 01:25:11.520
and for all to come together

01:25:11.660 --> 01:25:16.880
and decide who will win this 
year's most prestigious award.

01:25:17.030 --> 01:25:19.870
But before we meet these 
Anime of the Year nominees,

01:25:20.010 --> 01:25:22.690
a message from the last year's winner.

01:25:23.720 --> 01:25:24.800
Hello everyone!

01:25:24.970 --> 01:25:29.400
I am Yuma Takahashi, one of the producers 
of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.

01:25:30.040 --> 01:25:34.990
We were truly honored to receive
the Anime of the Year award last year.

01:25:35.980 --> 01:25:39.260
I would like to extend our heartfelt

01:25:39.400 --> 01:25:41.790
thanks to the Crunchyroll Anime Awards

01:25:42.040 --> 01:25:44.380
for this prestigious award

01:25:44.540 --> 01:25:46.880
and all the fans for their support.

01:25:47.960 --> 01:25:50.570
It has been such a humbling experience

01:25:50.710 --> 01:25:53.600
to see the fans' response to the show

01:25:53.780 --> 01:25:57.280
and we are extremely grateful

01:25:57.490 --> 01:25:59.960
for the love you have shown

01:26:00.110 --> 01:26:02.710
for the characters and the story.

01:26:03.800 --> 01:26:09.150
We hope you are looking forward to 
joining Tanjiro on his next mission

01:26:09.530 --> 01:26:13.050
when Demon Slayer - Kimetsu no 
Yaiba - The Movie: Mugen Train

01:26:13.170 --> 01:26:16.090
is available in theaters in North America.

01:26:17.450 --> 01:26:21.600
On behalf of the staff of Demon 
Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba,

01:26:21.740 --> 01:26:26.450
we would like to wish the best 
of luck to all the nominees

01:26:26.600 --> 01:26:30.780
of Crunchyroll Anime Awards 
2021, Anime of the Year!

01:26:30.920 --> 01:26:31.990
Thank you very much!

01:26:34.290 --> 01:26:38.480
It is my great pleasure 
to announce the nominees

01:26:38.610 --> 01:26:40.630
for Anime of the Year.

01:26:42.490 --> 01:26:43.710
The nominees are:

01:26:45.600 --> 01:26:48.300
JUJUTSU KAISEN
MAPPA

01:26:55.110 --> 01:26:57.600
DOROHEDORO
MAPPA

01:27:01.710 --> 01:27:04.630
GREAT PRETENDER
WIT STUDIO

01:27:09.340 --> 01:27:12.160
BEASTARS
ORANGE

01:27:17.050 --> 01:27:20.830
KEEP YOUR HANDS OFF EIZOUKEN!
Science SARU

01:27:25.780 --> 01:27:29.590
APPARE-RANMAN!
P.A.WORKS

01:27:41.200 --> 01:27:45.430
And the winner of Anime of the Year is...

01:27:48.110 --> 01:27:50.780
JUJUTSU KAISEN
MAPPA

01:28:07.130 --> 01:28:10.710
We also actually have an acceptance 
message from Sunghoo Park,

01:28:10.840 --> 01:28:12.410
the director of JUJUTSU KAISEN.

01:28:12.570 --> 01:28:14.360
So, let me read it out.

01:28:14.660 --> 01:28:17.880
"Sunghoo Park, director of the 
anime JUJUTSU KAISEN here.

01:28:18.040 --> 01:28:21.600
We're overjoyed to be able 
to win such an award today.

01:28:21.730 --> 01:28:24.870
Our staff is currently coming 
together and continuing to work hard

01:28:25.010 --> 01:28:28.080
as we make our way toward the final episode.

01:28:28.210 --> 01:28:32.060
We hope you'll all continue 
watching until the very end.

01:28:32.250 --> 01:28:35.630
We'd also like to take this moment 
to express our deep gratitude

01:28:35.780 --> 01:28:40.400
to all of the fans around the 
world supporting JUJUTSU KAISEN.

01:28:40.670 --> 01:28:43.710
Thank you very much.
Sunghoo Park"

01:29:21.330 --> 01:29:24.670
Oh wow! Congratulations to JUJUTSU KAISEN!

01:29:24.830 --> 01:29:27.210
And what a treat that we 
got a personal acceptance.

01:29:27.350 --> 01:29:28.850
So Tim, what did ya think?

01:29:28.980 --> 01:29:31.630
That was a wild ride, Hime.

01:29:31.770 --> 01:29:36.050
I can't believe 2020's Anime 
of the Year is JUJUTSU KAISEN!

01:29:36.180 --> 01:29:40.100
So, what do you all think about the winners? 
I know that chat's been going off.

01:29:40.350 --> 01:29:43.620
Before we go, we have to give a 
big thanks to our official judges

01:29:43.760 --> 01:29:47.500
and thanks to all of you fans for helping to 
name our winners tonight and for tuning in!

01:29:47.640 --> 01:29:50.670
Thank you to our co-streamers for 
extending the party to their channels.

01:29:50.840 --> 01:29:53.860
Let us know on social media how you 
felt about this year's results,

01:29:54.000 --> 01:29:57.170
and please send a note of congratulations 
to our wonderful winners.

01:29:57.340 --> 01:30:00.550
And finally, thank you, anime!

01:30:00.680 --> 01:30:03.340
You provided so many 
remarkable shows this year,

01:30:03.470 --> 01:30:07.900
and without you, there would 
be no anime, obviously.

01:30:08.060 --> 01:30:10.330
And no Anime Awards, full stop!

01:30:10.470 --> 01:30:14.370
Be sure to go to crunchyroll.com 
to watch some anime

01:30:14.510 --> 01:30:18.000
and enjoy what 2021 brings.

01:30:18.140 --> 01:30:19.130
I'm Tim Lyu.

01:30:19.130 --> 01:30:19.350
And I am Crunchyroll Hime.
I'm Tim Lyu.

01:30:19.350 --> 01:30:20.230
And I am Crunchyroll Hime.

01:30:20.370 --> 01:30:21.770
Thanks for watching everyone!

01:30:21.950 --> 01:30:23.380
Bye now!

01:30:28.310 --> 01:30:30.890
All right, Tim. Ready to 
go back to your world?

01:30:31.040 --> 01:30:33.760
Thanks Hime, but—ah, no thanks.

01:30:34.010 --> 01:30:37.680
I think I wanna stay right here.

